.TITLE{Code - Running Example with template}
.slide.font-size(4.3svh)

.CAST
```go
package main

import (
  "fmt"
)

func main() {
	false := true
	if false {
		fmt.Println("its true!")
	}
}
```

📜 use `r` key to run the code and `c` to close the terminal
