.PHP
```php
<?php
$smile     = 'smile';
$shrug     = 'shrug';
$facepalm  = 'php';

$opts = ['smile','shrug','facepalm'];
$pick = $opts[array_rand($opts)];

${$pick}();

function smile() { echo "😄\n";}
function shrug() { echo "¯\_(ツ)_/¯\n";}
function php() { echo "PHP\n";}
?>
```

📜 use `r` key to run the code and `c` to close the terminal
